  "limits": [
    "The target slots and recording must be stopped for edit/Undo; unrelated clips and held live notes stay active. Studio mode and unchanged history are required.",
    "Occupied destinations are preserved. MIDI uses the destination track instrument/routes and audio shares its immutable source.",
    "Native clip presets embed at most one 128 MiB PCM source and preserve existing files. Their strict schema currently matches project clip schema 20.",
    "Native project aggregate note/lane/media/metadata budgets and renderer History/queue payload budgets also apply.",
    "Audition first inserts a reviewed preset into an explicitly empty destination, then uses normal clip playback through that track. Source files remain intact.",
